{"4345060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BUDGE", "steam_appid": 4345060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4829240], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An online co-op adventure about carrying big loads through a perilous journey. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >online co-op for 2-6 players carrying one object with tight physics-based  movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ride atop a palanquin carried by your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hit people on the  head with a ceremonial staff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dodge boulders and avoid monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ending and the remnants of man have mustered one final offering to the gods! Your task is to gather what help you can and carry humanity's last offering to the great altar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and remember <strong>BUDGE</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;<strong>B</strong>ig<strong> U</strong>ndertakings <strong>D</strong>emands <strong>G</strong>roup <strong>E</strong>ffort&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345060/extras/b4ada905f584ec9da1bdd606dcd0639f.avif?t=1786676764\" width=256 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An online co-op adventure about carrying big loads through a perilous journey. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >online co-op fo